{
  "name": "dsh-output-shape",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "输出形状插件（ADHD 友好）：把 ayghri/i-have-adhd 的 10 条规则做成 DSH 可用的两种形态 —— ① 默认注册技能 i-have-adhd（按需调用，说\"关闭 ADHD 模式\"即停）；② 可选常驻注入 system prompt（默认关，段名 dsh-output-shape:output-shape、order 405）。规则真源只有一份：skills/i-have-adhd/SKILL.md，常驻注入直接读它的正文（剥 frontmatter），不会漂。蒸馏自 GitHub 项目 ayghri/i-have-adhd（MIT）。默认不常驻，是为了不和 dsh-cache-control 的会话守则 R4 重复注入 —— 要切换请先把 R4 从 session-gate.md 删掉。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "skill",
    "output-style",
    "adhd",
    "concise",
    "system-prompt"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node tools/run-all.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "skills",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "NOTICE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": "^0.1.2-alpha.1"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Raylen-berry/dsh-output-shape.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Raylen-berry/dsh-output-shape/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Raylen-berry/dsh-output-shape#readme",
  "license": "MIT"
}
